WEBVTT

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.860
The village is completely abandoned!

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:09.350
A reflection of Alvin-san's 
chronic unpopularity?!

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.440
People wouldn't disappear from a 
village because I'm unpopular!

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.980
More likely, they heard you 
were coming and ran off!

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:21.040
If they knew I was coming, 
they'd be lining up to shake my hand!

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.720
It's all right, Celia-chan.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.080
I promise we'll save the dwarves.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.250
Dwarves... a race with which 
we do not get along well.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.790
Do elves and dwarves have 
some kind of history?

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.030
Yes.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:39.260
I once tried to get a dwarf-owned clothing 
shop to knock down their prices, and failed.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.050
That's a <i>personal</i> history!

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:42.530
It's got nothing to do with your race!

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:43.920
Hey!

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:47.060
I looked all around, but they 
weren't in the village.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:47.930
Here, either.

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:50.100
They must have been taken off somewhere!

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.170
I see.

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:54.570
But I'll make sure there 
are no hidden injured.

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.480
You've got a spell for that?

00:00:56.480 --> 00:01:00.700
I have a healer's ability to locate 
the weakened and vulnerable.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.410
Sounds like a predator seeking out prey...

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.900
Then... O, sacred power.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.310
I pray thee, let me save 
the injured and abandoned.

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:13.600
Reveal to me the location 
of the sad and the weak.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.630
Wow, looks like it's really working!

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.600
Nah, it's creepy.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.260
Seek them!

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:23.540
If we find any weakened nearby, 
I guess we'll have to save them.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.770
I'm picking up something nearby!

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:28.770
And they're indeed in 
quite a weakened state!

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:30.710
What? Where are they?!

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:35.900
I'm not particularly weakened...

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:38.550
Yeah, sorry. You were weak from the start.

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:40.730
Please! I'm very resilient!

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:46.040
But how are we supposed to save the people 
if we don't know where they been taken?

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.420
Good question...

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:48.750
I heard!

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:52.100
The bad people took them 
into the castle dungeon!

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.100
Over there!

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:57.920
Definitely the kind of place 
you'd expect to find a villain.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.970
Don't Hurt Me,

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.970
Don't Hurt Me,

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.970
My Healer!

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:06.850
<b>We've reached the final episode at last...</b>

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.450
Oh, I'm so worried!

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:06.840
I just hope they're doing okay!

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.480
Calm down already.

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:09.560
They'll be fine.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:10.830
What are you talking about?

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.760
Hush! Celia-chan finally got to sleep!

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:17.150
They're up against Dorman, 
a tried-and-true villain!

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:21.510
It's true, I doubt Big Sis's fast-talk 
abilities will do much here.

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:22.610
Right?

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:25.630
I sure hope they come back safely!

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:27.290
Carla-chan...

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:33.960
What's that you've got there?

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.110
Camouflage.

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:36.890
You stand out like a sore 
thumb. Knock it off.

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:37.710
Get down!

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.440
Hey. What's up, brothers?

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:41.720
Anything sign of trouble?

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.350
That's...

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.430
Prison!

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.240
It's <i>Brigan</i>...

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.000
And that's certainly a 
unique way of laying low.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.760
No one's coming to this rotten place.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:55.140
And the dwarves still won't tell 
you where the artifact is?

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:58.480
Yeah, and I don't wanna 
get too rough with them.

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:00.860
They're first-rate craftsmen.

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:03.520
They'll fetch big money if we can 
sell them in good condition.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:06.530
So he's working with Dorman?

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:07.790
Looks like...

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:10.520
He's a disgrace to the name "adventurer"!

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:11.840
Scouting complete.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:12.470
Great!

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:17.100
On the castle's left side, there's a 
walled-in building that looks like a prison.

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.180
Right.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.100
Thankfully, tonight's a new moon.

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:22.480
We can break in under cover of darkness.

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:24.010
Stay quiet, all right?

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.860
No talking from here on out!

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:28.350
Wh-What now?!

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:35.210
Your hand signals are really annoying!

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:39.460
My idea was, "Let's have Ryoko-san 
carry us inside the wall."

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:40.560
How was I supposed to know that?!

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:42.230
Wait, can you really do that?

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:46.540
If it's just the two of you, 
I can carry you inside my body.

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:48.900
Inside your dre—

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:51.040
Inside her pack.

00:03:57.530 --> 00:03:58.660
We're here.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:00.700
Stay quiet.

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:03.870
There are two magic warriors 
standing guard outside the wall.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:08.950
The prison itself has a dark spell 
cast upon it, so I cannot enter.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.060
Take care.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.920
Sure thing. Thanks!

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:14.530
No sign of guards, eh?

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:16.350
And the doors are wide open!

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:19.050
Good thing Brigan's so sloppy.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.510
What, here to question us again?!

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:24.600
We'll never tell you where the artifact is!

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:26.510
Hush! Be quiet!

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:28.130
The guards outside will hear you.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:29.620
We're on your side!

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:30.360
Indeed.

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:33.120
With a heart of benevolence and mercy...

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.370
I've come to save you dwarves, 
whom I don't even like!

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:38.810
Shut up! You're making things complicated!

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:40.750
I-Is the mayor here?

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:43.780
I am the mayor.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.090
<b>I am the Dwarf mayor.
 The great sorcerer of darkness,
Dorman, is attacking our village 
to try to steal our sacred artifact.
 If Dorman retrieves the artifact, 
the world will be destroyed.
Brave warrior, I beg of you, 
foil Dorman's plot! Please!
 I am the Dwarf mayor.</b>

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.090
I see.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.990
So you're the ones who 
saved my granddaughter!

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:50.090
I can't thank you enough.

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:52.840
She's hiding in a safe place for now.

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:55.350
Dorman's after your artifact, I hear.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:56.470
Yes.

00:04:56.470 --> 00:05:00.860
The artifact has sacred power 
that can drive off dark magic.

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.110
Dorman fears it.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:07.260
This castle is a fortress 
built by our ancestors.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:09.110
It's in ruins now,

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:12.670
but the artifact is hidden 
deep in its depths.

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.110
I'll tell you where to find it.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.640
Will you defeat Dorman and save us all?

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.290
What is it?

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.330
If you want to ask for someone's help,

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:23.660
shouldn't you kneel down in front 
of them and press your forehead—

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.530
Can you not?!

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.430
We beg of you!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.170
Please!

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:38.260
It took time to collect what we 
needed, but we made it inside.

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:40.260
A fork already?

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:41.850
Do we go straight here?

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:42.430
Yes.

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:44.360
Go straight and you'll hit a pit trap.

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:46.750
Don't say "yes" first.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.150
I'll be more careful.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.910
A dead end.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.480
It's been quite a maze so far.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:52.920
You think we took a wrong turn?

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:57.920
We've been following the map the 
mayor drew for us to a T.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.870
But if we press the triangle lithograph—

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.670
I see. A hidden door?

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.800
No, it springs a pit trap.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.400
Thanks again!

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:08.760
Talk faster next time!

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.060
I'll be more careful.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:13.540
The artifact should be inside this room.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.910
He told you how to open this door, right?

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:16.690
Yes.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:19.360
If you turn the rightmost 
statue ninety degrees left...

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:21.690
Got it. If I turn it left—

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:22.920
Will it spring a trap?

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:25.740
Yes, and you'll have a perfect 
sweep of the pit traps.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:27.020
That's not a good thing!

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:29.830
You weren't refining your special talent?

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.570
I never embraced that at a talent!

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:35.200
And I feel bad for making Ryoko-chan 
save me every time I fall!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.930
Just tell me the right way 
to do things already!

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:39.080
No fun...

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:47.240
Dwarven technology is incredible!

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.460
Look at all this!

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:51.180
Dwarves make incredible lingerie, as well.

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:53.250
Underwear's not really on the same level!

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.620
Is that the artifact?!

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:56.770
It does appear so.

00:06:57.380 --> 00:07:00.590
I doubt it'll be trapped, 
but wait here just in case.

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:01.260
Right.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:04.670
Not quite what I expected...

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:06.010
Thanks for showing me the way.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:06.820
What?!

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:10.730
Lord Dorman sees all!

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:13.110
Brigan! And is that...

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:15.510
The great sorcerer of darkness, Dorman?!

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:18.370
I noticed dark elf magic about...

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.010
And it's truly led me to the jackpot!

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:23.360
My magic? You mean, you noticed my charms?!

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:24.900
No, your literal magic.

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:27.570
You can't notice what doesn't exist!

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:30.260
Now, hand over the crown!

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:31.890
Not a chance!

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:33.620
Wait a minute, Alvin-san!

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:35.520
I'll handle this!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:39.760
Aren't you skipping an obligatory 
evil boss character line right now?

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:41.470
Oh? And what's that?

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:44.510
You're supposed to offer to 
give us half the world!

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:46.610
We might be willing to negotiate!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.860
That's not a thing good guys say!

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:51.410
Sorry, but I'm not here to negotiate...

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:55.980
But hand it over and I'll be willing 
to make you soldiers in my army.

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:57.820
What do you think, Alvin?

00:07:57.820 --> 00:07:59.620
I'll certainly put you to good use!

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.540
No, <i>I'll</i> put him to good use!

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.070
I don't want either!

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:04.510
In that case...

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:10.310
Carla-san!

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:12.120
Damn it! Let go of Carla!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.640
Well? Ready to give me the crown yet?!

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:23.100
Are you all right, Carla-chan?

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.600
Anna-san! Thank you!

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.490
I got worried and had to come!

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:27.640
Alvin, now!

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:28.490
Okay!

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:31.500
Hear me, artifact! Destroy the dark magic!

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:32.520
Fool!

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:38.630
Why...?!

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:39.870
Alvin-san!

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.100
Alvin!

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:44.390
Drop that weapon, now!

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.260
Now, bring me the crown...

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:50.190
Unless you <i>want</i> me to start 
carving up her face?

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.510
Don't do it! Run!

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.210
Forget about me!

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:55.090
Go, before they take the crown!

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:55.960
But...

00:08:55.960 --> 00:09:00.160
I'll be safe as long as I have 
value to them as a hostage.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:04.070
Besides, just once, I wanted to 
sound like a real female lead!

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:05.810
S-Sure...

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.070
Ryoko-chan, we're getting out of here!

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:08.550
Right!

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:09.950
You won't escape!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.620
Throw the girl in the dungeon!

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.100
Find them! And take the crown!

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:22.100
Aren't you lucky you have value to us?

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:24.410
Dark elves fetch a high price, after all...

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.910
Ain't this a pretty picture?

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:39.700
The disaster land mine healer 
is abandoned by her partner

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:41.210
and ends up all alone again!

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:44.010
Alvin-san <i>will</i> come to save me!

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:46.530
If there's one thing he understands, 
it's how to read the mood!

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:47.680
Give that back!

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:49.170
Nuh-uh!

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:52.180
I'm taking this as payment 
for the time you kicked me.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.990
Now stay in there and be good.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:55.210
Give it back! Give it back!

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:56.190
Prison!

00:09:57.980 --> 00:10:00.690
Was that thing really that important to you?

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:02.700
Certainly nack!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:02.450
<b>Ack</b>

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:06.190
It's not a memento of the first 
dungeon I ever beat or anythack!

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:05.950
<b>Ack</b>

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:08.190
You're a very transparent one.

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:11.480
But that adventurer partner of yours...

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:13.840
Are you sure he can handle this?

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:17.750
Alvin-san...

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:19.900
I see.

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:22.100
Carla let herself be captured.

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:23.720
Big Sis...

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:26.340
I'm sorry. I wish I'd been able to do more.

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:27.860
You did the best you could!

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.080
I'd like to go save her right away, but...

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:32.310
If the artifact is useless...

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:35.050
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:38.690
Hey, how far away from the castle are we?

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:40.960
At least two kilometers, I'm sure.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:44.280
The death-upon-separation 
curse didn't activate!

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:47.150
What? Where did Altargaia-san go?

00:10:47.150 --> 00:10:50.050
You don't think he went to 
save Carla all on his own?!

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:52.620
If he left without telling us, 
it means he probably ran away!

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:54.430
Not that I can blame him...

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:56.070
But you haven't run away.

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:59.560
Even though you said you'd ditch this 
party on the spot if not for the curse...

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.270
Party, eh?

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.590
You're right. I guess I'd better.

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:06.470
Yeah, I'll run away!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:09.580
It's not like I stand a chance, 
with this thing being busted and all...

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:10.640
Blasphemer!

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:11.320
It talked!

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:13.080
Wh-What the...

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:18.230
My power waxes and wanes with the moon!

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:22.810
Tonight is a new moon, 
when my power is at its weakest!

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:27.130
That is why Dorman chose <i>this</i> day to strike!

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:29.830
And that's why your power 
didn't activate then?

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.870
But there is a way to restore my power.

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.460
Have a healer cast a spell on me!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.610
A healer?

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:42.550
A powerful healing spell will 
let me use my full powers!

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:45.110
Can I ask you a question?

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:48.370
There was a strange curse on me that 
seems to have abruptly broken.

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:49.790
Is it because of you?

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:51.270
It is possible!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:54.340
Holy power likely purged it naturally!

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:55.790
I see...

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:59.520
Then even if I leave Carla 
behind, I wouldn't die?

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:02.740
Carla? Is that the girl 
you were with earlier?

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:03.500
Yeah...

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:05.630
There's something I must tell you!

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:09.900
You and that girl carry a powerful 
bond from a previous life!

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:10.880
What?!

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:12.980
It happened half a century ago!

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:16.670
You were elves, and you were in love.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:20.730
But your clan was destroyed by the armies 
of the great sorcerer of darkness.

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:24.940
You swore that you'd be 
reunited in your new lives!

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:28.590
And now, though you've lost your 
memories of your past lives,

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:31.900
that bond of destiny has 
brought you back together!

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:33.360
Carla and I were...

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:36.900
And if you defeat that dark sorcerer, 
your sworn enemy,

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.870
you will be bonded forever in true love!

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:42.430
True love?!

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.050
Wait a minute... Half a century ago?

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:47.180
Carla might look like a kid in human terms,

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:49.450
but I'm pretty sure she's 
been alive for 72 years!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:51.260
W-Well, that's...

00:12:51.260 --> 00:12:54.220
And if they were in love in a past life,

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:56.970
wouldn't they get along a little better now?

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:58.580
That's true.

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:02.780
Fine, I guess it didn't work!

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:05.730
I thought that little speech 
might help motivate you, but...

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:06.450
Are you kidding me?!

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:07.010
Escape!

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:07.850
Not a chance!

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:10.500
I'm sorry! Forgive me!

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:12.380
I am this party's warrior!

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:13.840
I <i>will</i> fulfill my role!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:16.650
Even if I am beginner level 100,

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.990
and adventurer rank lol-in-parentheses!

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:22.110
I will not abandon the ideals of justice!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.810
Hang on... Are you really that weak?

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:26.660
I shouldn't have said anything.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.820
I don't see any lookouts.

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:32.000
It seems like a total trap, but...

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.360
You hear me?

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:37.130
First, place me at the center 
of the magic-sealing circle!

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:40.020
I'll break the barrier with my holy power.

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:44.190
Then you can use magic, 
even within the dungeon!

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:46.920
Wh-What's wrong?

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:49.970
Sorry, I guess my magic's 
way too low for that...

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:51.890
You are so useless!

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:54.340
Darn it... what would we have done if

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:57.090
Ryoko-san hadn't lent me her cleaning supplies?!

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:59.330
She seems like a very useful maid!

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:00.890
Way more useful than you!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.580
Damn you, Brigan!

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:04.260
Of course he locked it!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.070
Ryoko-chan, I need you!

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:06.730
Right!

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.660
Here we are!

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:13.000
You call? I come!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.050
It's Carla!

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:15.500
I'll be annoyed about that later!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:18.280
First, cast a powerful healing 
spell on this crown!

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:19.770
Righty-o!

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:21.780
Ryoko-san told me everything!

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:22.760
Here I go!

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:27.930
Holy power, infuse this crown 
with the light of resurrection!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.660
I'm infusing it with my spirit, too!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.020
Evil spirit?!

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:34.800
I'm in no position to 
entertain your bad jokes!

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:38.400
I feel sick!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.260
How do you feel, Artifact-san?

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:44.810
It was a good try, but your 
magic power was insufficient!

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:45.910
It's hopeless, then?

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:48.490
What?!

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:50.670
That was quite an amusing show!

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:56.370
Give up already, Alvin!

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:59.260
They knew we were here!

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:00.580
Ryoko-chan, get us out!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:01.350
Right!

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:03.200
Ryoko-san!

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:04.460
You won't escape!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:09.150
I'm gonna give you a beating 
before I take that crown.

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:10.900
Get it, Alvin-san?

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:12.570
Then, I'll take the healer.

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:14.590
I get the immobilized maid? No fun.

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:16.550
Damn it! What do we do?

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:21.190
If we could escape now, we could try 
again under the full moon, but...

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.690
Alvin-san...

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:26.450
Is it all over?!

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:27.420
Not yet!

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:28.220
Carla!

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:30.960
For the sake of the mayor 
who groveled before me,

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.500
I will not give up the artifact!

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:33.700
I'll fight with you!

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:35.840
It's too much!

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:37.400
You'll both be killed!

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:38.670
Someone...

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.160
Someone help us!

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:42.680
What?

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:45.720
Hey, we made it!

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:46.540
Is everyone safe?

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:47.930
Altargaia-san!

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:48.820
Anna-san?

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:49.830
And the golem!

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:50.850
You guys all came!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.090
The forest folk are here, too, gao!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:55.460
We shall fight by your side, moo!

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:57.100
We don't stand for villains here!

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:58.730
We crush them!

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:01.110
Especially those who would bully Carla-chan!

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:02.100
You all...

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.600
What nice folks!

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:05.630
We still outnumber them!

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:06.610
Go!

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:07.770
Kuma!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:08.510
Moo!

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:11.340
C-Come bat me, bwiends!

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:16.530
We knew what you were going for. 
Chin up!

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:19.170
Really? I don't need to try it again?

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:21.500
Feel the wrath of my medicine!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.800
Oink! And now I'll finish you!

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.630
Hecaton Cyclone!

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:27.560
Oink!

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:28.760
What's the matter?

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:30.630
I twisted my ankle...

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.390
Here's a poultice.

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:34.840
I won't let you inside!

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:36.900
There's still fighting outside!

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:39.510
It's not safe, so please 
wait here until it's over!

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:40.460
Grandpa!

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:41.550
Celia!

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:42.840
You're safe!

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:44.510
Celia did good!

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:46.090
You did a fine job, Celia!

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:48.130
Well done, Celia!

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:47.620
Celia?

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:49.610
I guess she still speaks in baby talk.

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:49.600
More praise!

00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:50.500
Shu-wah!

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:55.530
These stupid puppets don't know 
to look away. Makes it easy!

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:58.320
Your magic won't work on me!

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:01.080
Now here's your punishment for defying me!

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.150
Me next! Me!

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:05.360
Why don't you stick to your "Shu-wah"?

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:07.430
Aw, I wanna do it, too!

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:10.600
Brigun! I need a heal!

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:12.430
Brother Brigin! I'm on my way!

00:17:14.190 --> 00:17:15.690
You shall not pass!

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:18.820
Give him lots of punishment.

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:21.560
Call us queen!

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:24.130
The rest of you are up against me!

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:25.490
Wait a moment!

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:28.610
I won't let you harm them!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:30.060
Get them, Big Sis!

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.910
We'll protect Maria-san!

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:32.690
Yeah!

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:35.330
Do my bidding, Undead Wolf!

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:36.450
I'm in this, too!

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.430
Maria-san, thank you!

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:46.160
Creepy but friendly is a strange combination!

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.150
I-Is it?

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:50.040
Ellie, put yourself away.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.070
Okay!

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:52.470
Run!

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:53.770
Run, run!

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:54.670
Catch me if you can!

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:56.160
Serves you right!

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:58.120
Let's bury them all!

00:17:58.120 --> 00:17:59.680
Bury them!

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.730
Go on, open me!

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:04.180
I'll scare the pants off 
you and get my promotion!

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.690
Someone open me already!

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:09.410
This is taking longer than I expected...

00:18:09.410 --> 00:18:10.070
Yes.

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:11.450
Carla-chan, above you!

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:14.360
Nice going, dear!

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:15.530
Awesome!

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.650
You saved me. Thank you.

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:18.510
Sure...

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:22.290
Still, these things just keep coming! 
It never ends!

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:25.200
Indeed. If we can't cut them off 
at the source, we're doomed.

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.050
Oh?

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:27.110
Where's Alvin?

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:28.690
Look there, everyone!

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:31.430
Alvin-san!

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:35.600
He ran off on his own, bear?

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:36.790
It appears so...

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:41.030
Alvin's the only one with the item 
that can oppose Dorman, after all!

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:43.340
But my magic power was too weak.

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:45.720
I wasn't able to restore the artifact.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:46.560
Oh, no!

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:48.490
Then, at this rate...

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:50.550
Eventually, we'll all tire ourselves out...

00:18:50.550 --> 00:18:51.950
...and we'll be dead.

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:55.900
So, you just need a magic boost, bear?

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.380
Took you long enough, adventurer!

00:18:58.380 --> 00:18:58.770
What—

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:00.040
Crap!

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.290
I failed!

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:02.770
Thought you could catch me by surprise?

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:07.240
Without the power of that crown, 
you can't even put up a fight against me!

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:08.320
Oh, shut up!

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:10.210
Whine all you like, dog.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.640
Once that crown's gone, I'll be invincible!

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:14.800
The world will be mine!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:18.000
I'll erase it along with your head!

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.210
Alvin-san!

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:20.960
Carla!

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:22.340
He's caught!

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:26.630
Holy power, infuse this crown 
with the light of resurrection!

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:28.550
<i>That mace I gave you has the 
power to amplify magic, bear!</i>

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:33.290
Power overwhelming!

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:36.040
Alvin, remove your helmet 
and put me on your head!

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:36.810
Sure thing!

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:38.130
Curse you!

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:46.320
I will defeat you myself!

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:49.650
Then I'll have to remove 
your head and steal it!

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:54.470
My body feels light!

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:55.960
That's because I'm supporting you!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:57.030
Incredible!

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:58.410
He's like a different person!

00:19:58.410 --> 00:19:59.590
Appearance-wise, too!

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:00.840
Are they even?

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.100
No, he's being beaten...

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.340
I'll support him!

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:06.700
Alvin-san!

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:08.890
It's my enhancement spell!

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:09.520
Take it!

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:10.690
That one?!

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:11.740
I'll be taking that!

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:17.930
What... What exactly did that enhance?!

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:20.060
Your flavor and mouthfeel!

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:25.950
Great job, Carla!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:28.850
I resent this slightly, but I'm glad!

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:30.200
Wrong way!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.800
Thanks, everyone!

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:39.590
Triplets?

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:42.000
Dorman was pretty old, huh?

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.960
That was quite an accomplishment!

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.980
I'm sure you'll get proper stars 
at your next ranking test!

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:49.330
I barely beat an old man...

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:51.940
And with the artifact's support, at that!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:54.180
Oh, I forgot!

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:58.550
I'm taking this back—

00:20:58.550 --> 00:20:59.740
Tieshankao!

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:02.810
Good to see her as energetic as ever.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:07.960
You really like that medal, huh?

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:11.000
N-Never mind that. 
Let's return to the village!

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:13.520
We need to return the artifact to the mayor.

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:18.460
I truly don't know how to thank you!

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.330
We're the ones who should thank you.

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:22.290
Because of you, my curse is gone!

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:23.690
Yes...

00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:26.460
R-Regarding that...

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:30.620
The curse <i>could</i> reactivate once I'm gone!

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:32.330
Best to be safe!

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:33.980
No way!

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:37.980
Kinoko-chan, Ghost-san, everyone! Goodbye!

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:39.600
Take care!

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:41.700
We'll come back to play soon!

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:44.520
<i>Stuck with Carla for now, huh?</i>

00:21:44.520 --> 00:21:47.070
<i>But after being on my own for so long,</i>

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.370
<i>I'm suddenly part of a party...</i>

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:52.360
<i>They're definitely an idiosyncratic bunch...</i>

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:56.670
<i>But without them, I wouldn't 
have been able to fight Dorman!</i>

00:21:57.360 --> 00:21:59.880
<i>Do I owe it all to Carla?</i>

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:03.120
Is there a reason you're staring at me now?

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:04.270
N-No...

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:05.220
Don't tell me...

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:09.480
After watching my brilliance in combat, 
you've fallen in love with me?!

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:09.890
Huh?

00:22:10.150 --> 00:22:13.400
It was quite a showcase for 
my ample charms, after all!

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:14.390
What are you talking about?

00:22:14.650 --> 00:22:16.720
I certainly appreciate the sentiment...

00:22:16.720 --> 00:22:17.580
Listen to me!

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:19.910
But I feel that you are...

00:22:19.910 --> 00:22:21.020
so pathetic!

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:22.770
Pathetic!

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:24.270
Shut up!

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:28.270
This healer's a pain in my ass!
